          tip: 'Temperatures at the summit run 10–15°C cooler than the coast — bring a layer even in winter. The road is fully tarmacked and accessible by regular car.',
        },
        {
          time: 'Afternoon',
          icon: '☀️',
          title: 'Jebel Jais Flight — World\'s Longest Zipline',
